"""Prepared reference solution for ``flag_gems.max_pool2d_with_indices`` (musa / vendor mthreads).

Reference-as-solution preparation artifact only.  It is injected through the
official FlagGems pytest override option::

    --override max_pool2d_with_indices:/abs/path/prepared/reference.py:run

and is therefore observed by the project probe exactly like a candidate
solution.  It computes the two frozen Definition outputs ``(values, indices)``
with the native ATen implementation - the same oracle expression the frozen
accuracy suite (``tests/test_max_pool2d.py``) and the frozen core benchmark
(``benchmark/test_max_pool2d.py``) already use - on the input's own device and
dtype.

Fidelity notes (definitions/max_pool2d_with_indices.json):
  * signature ``(input, kernel_size, stride=None, padding=0, dilation=1, ceil_mode=False)``
